Claude System Prompt — Travel Request Extraction Agent
This is the system prompt used in the Claude: анализ и статус node. It's documented separately from the workflow JSON so the prompt logic and iteration history are easy to review without digging through node parameters.
Purpose
Given a customer's message (plus prior conversation history and any already-known data), the agent must:

Extract structured trip data
Decide whether enough information exists to proceed
Either ask a targeted clarifying question, ask for confirmation of collected data, or flag the lead as ready for a human manager
